
Example:
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 300 360 --dec -15 -13 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite

Targets must have IN_IBIS=1, IN_HSC!=1, and DONE=0, as well as match the
requested RA, DEC, and filter. HSC targets are excluded before non-overlap trimming.
The input must include IN_HSC so the exclusion can always be applied.

By default, PROGRAM=LBNL is selected. To select different programs or remove
the restriction (including blank labels), use:
./make_cfht_targets.py --program LBNL
./make_cfht_targets.py --program LBNL NAOC
./make_cfht_targets.py --program ""
./make_cfht_targets.py --all-programs

Program matching ignores case. Future program names are accepted without changing the script;
multiple --program options are combined into one list.

Night planning (requires numpy and astropy; see requirements.txt):
python update_tile_priorities.py
python update_lmst_design.py
python make_cfht_targets.py --night 2026-09-09
python make_cfht_targets.py --night 2026-09-09 --twilight 18 --exptime 150 --overhead 44 --program LBNL

--night is the Hawaii calendar date of the evening. Defaults are 15-degree
twilight, 130-second exposures, and 44-second overheads. Outputs include
evening/morning LMST bounds, FITS/XML queues in time order, and a
targets-YYYY-MM-DD.schedule.ecsv table with every slot and any unfilled slots.
The --lmst-window option sets the allowed LMST_DESIGN mismatch in degrees
(default +/-5 degrees); within that window the highest PRIORITY wins,
with lower declination breaking ties. PRIORITY is assigned from stripe
years (Y1=10.0, Y2=9.0, Y3=8.0, Y4=7.0, Y5=6.0), taking the maximum
where stripes overlap. All IN_IBIS=1 rows are assigned regardless of DONE
or IN_HSC; unassigned stripe locations retain a fallback of 1.0.
See docs/night-planning.md for the design mapping, timing model, and limitations.
Night planning uses local Earth-orientation and leap-second files in data/iers/;
it does not download anything and works with Astropy 4.3.1 or newer.

Additional targets for NAOC time
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 234 250 --dec 4 10 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite --prefix targets-2026-09-08-A
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 307 360 --dec -12 -6 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite --prefix targets-2026-09-08-B
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 0 56 --dec -15 -7 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite --prefix targets-2026-09-08-C
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 130 225 --dec -7 1 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite --prefix targets-2026-09-08-D
